  "issue": 403,
  "request": "Goal: Implement Issue 403 for the Spec-Driven Development flow final-regression step. Scope: Change final-regression failure handling so a failed run is classified, saved as evidence, and can either trigger a fix-and-rerun path or a record-and-proceed path when eligible. Include status and final report display so record-and-proceed never appears as pass. Out of Scope: npm publishing, unrelated workflow steps, ignoring current-diff regressions, and proceeding when required state or artifact writing is broken. Description: On the first final-regression failure, recommend fixing and rerunning. After a fix attempt and repeated eligible failure, recommend recording and proceeding. Classification must distinguish assertion failure from execution failure and record whether the cause is caused_by_current_change, existing_failure, out_of_scope, environment, sandbox, timeout, dependency, or flaky_suspected with evidence linking the decision to command output and current diff relationship.",
